@host = http://localhost:5006
@token = paste-token-from-verify

### 1. Ask for a login code (shows in the Output window in Development)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9876543210" }

### 2. Sign in
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9876543210", "code": "123456" }

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Raise this month's bills now
POST {{host}}/api/v1/fees/raise
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### This month's bills
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fees?month=2026-11&status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remind every family with unpaid fees
POST {{host}}/api/v1/fees/remind-all?month=2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record a cash payment
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "STUDENT-ID", "dueIds": ["DUE-ID"], "amount": 1500, "mode": "Cash", "paidOn": "2026-11-05", "note": "" }

### Attendance register
GET {{host}}/api/v1/attendance/BATCH-ID?date=2026-11-05
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Collection report
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/collection?month=2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Plans for this centre
GET {{host}}/api/v1/billing/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
